All checks passed. git diff --check: passed.

Scope: patterned-layer shapes AND background must share a finite common
Im(epsilon)/Re(epsilon), with positive real parts and nonnegative imaginary
parts. Different layers may have different ratios. Uniform layers accept
independent passive positive-real-part permittivities. Geometry and common
loss remain live under a frozen plan; derivatives must stay within that
material family. A lossy inclusion in a lossless background, or differing
loss ratios within one patterned layer, still requires a general complex
corrector and is not implemented here. These controls do not cover the
entire repository suite or certify optical convergence.
